```

## 5. Target Types

Valid target section names:

- `console`
- `consoleless`
- `header_lib`
- `static_lib`
- `dyn_lib`
- `obj_lib`
- `test`
- `driver`

Useful aliases accepted by `bbs` include: `gui`, `header-lib`, `headerlib`, `static-lib`, `staticlib`, `dyn-lib`, `shared_lib`, `shared-lib`, `obj-lib`, `object_lib`, `object-lib`.

Default recommendation:

- executable CLI app -> `console`
- reusable compiled library -> `static_lib`
- header-only library -> `header_lib`
- tests -> `test`

